# Always commit and push

When finishing user-requested feature/fix work in this repo:

1. Commit the relevant files (skip unrelated line-ending noise).
2. Push to `origin/main` without waiting for the user to ask again.
3. If direct GitHub fails, use the established ghproxy + PAT push path, then scrub the token from `remote.origin.url`.
4. Confirm with the short commit hash after a successful push.
